OL,3,GNEWSAThousands to be offered home HPV
OL,4,Atests in county
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of women in Lincolnshire who
OL,7,Fhave not attended cervical screening
OL,8,Fappointments will be offered a home HPV
OL,9,Ftesting kit as part of a national
OL,10,Fscheme.
OL,12,FThe NHS said it was providing
OL,13,Fself-testing kits to encourage women to
OL,14,Ftake part in screening to detect human
OL,15,Fpapillomavirus (HPV), which can
OL,16,Fincrease the risk of cervical cancer.
OL,18,FDr Dave Briggs from NHS Lincolnshire
OL,19,FIntegrated Care Board (ICB) said 73% of
OL,20,Feligible women were up to date with
OL,21,Ftheir cervical screening in the county,
OL,22,Fwhich was below the national target.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
